  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Artistic Microenterprise Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAT will strengthen the artistic and organizational capacity of approximately 50 young people who make up the Stela Marys theater group. The theater group is made up of members from five greater Asuncin area public high schools and is housed at the Stela Marys high school. It will train the young people how to administer, market, and organize a community cultural center as well as assist them in obtaining legal status for the center. There are two main goals: 1.) Build the capacity of the students to run a community cultural center as a non-profit community foundation that helps attract resources to address the needs in the community; and 2.) transform the community theater group so that it can expand its offering of artistic services that will generate income for its members and provide additional resources to invest in their communities.</narrative>
  </description>
